\section{Experiments}
\label{sec:experiments}
For the German$\rightarrow$English translation task, we train an NMT system based on the WMT 2016 training data \cite{bojar2016findings} (3.9M parallel sentences).
For the Chinese$\rightarrow$English experiments, we use an NMT system trained on 11 million sentences from the BOLT project.

